flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Hijack the nuclear waste convoy and escape with the cesium by any means necessary."])
 _A1_(["The crew speeds toward the fabrication plant and spills out by the goods entrance."])
 _A1_1_(["Engineer makes for the crane as the others confront the security team."])
 _A1_2_(["A trio of burly guards approaches to confront the crew."])
 _A1_C1_{"Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 draw their weapons and try to take down the guards."}
 _A1_C1F_["The guards manage to hold off the crew, and the heavy goods door begins to close."]
 _A1_3_(["Muscle #1 is pinned by gunfire, so Sniper aims his rifle from a distance."])
 _A1_C2_{"Sniper tries to pick off the guards while Muscle #2 charges forward."}
 _A1_C2P_["Sniper clears the way, allowing Muscle #2 to reach the door controls."]
 _A1_4_(["Muscle #2 drops the final guard and halts the door&#39;s closing sequence."])
 _A2_(["With the guards cleared, Sniper and Lookout take up a vantage point across the road."])
 _A2_1_(["Bomber sets up the remote detonator while the others keep watch for trouble."])
 _A2_2_(["From the top of the crane, Engineer observes the convoy leaving the nuclear plant."])
 _A2_3_(["Engineer uses the crane to collect a container and guide it into position."])
 _A2_C1_{"Lookout uses his binoculars to track the convoy and help Engineer time the drop."}
 _A2_C1P_["The container drops in the truck&#39;s path and it screeches to a halt."]
 _A3_C1_{"Bomber primes the remote detonator and tries to blow the road behind."}
 _A3_C1P_["The tunnel bomb explodes, collapsing the road and halting the convoy&#39;s retreat."]
 _A4_(["Finding themselves boxed into a choke point, the convoy&#39;s guards take up defensive positions."])
 _A4_1_(["Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 provide covering fire to keep the guards occupied."])
 _A4_C1_{"Sniper and Lookout open fire, allowing Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 to move in."}
 _A4_C1F_["The guards stand their ground, forcing Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 to take cover."]
 _A4_C2_{"Lookout spots for Sniper, hoping to keep the guards contained."}
 _A4_C2P_["Three guards are cut down as the others rush to hide in a building to the north."]
 _A5_(["Sniper fire from Sniper keeps the guards pinned while the others approach the vehicle."])
 _A5_1_(["Returning from the crane, Engineer steps forward and scrutinizes the reinforced access door."])
 _A5_C1_{"Engineer and Bomber set the shaped charge on the weakest part of the door frame."}
 _A5_C1F_["The shaped charge detonates but fails to breach the reinforced door."]
 _A5_2_(["Searching the truck cabin for a solution, Engineer finds a pry bar tucked in the footwell."])
 _A5_C2_{"Engineer and Bomber work at the locking clamps, trying to wrench the door open."}
 _A5_C2F_["The clamps resist all attempts to dislodge them, the door remaining stuck fast."]
 _B5_(["Bomber raids one of the security vehicles for equipment that might help."])
 _B5_1_(["Bomber strips grenades from the SWAT SUV and wires them into a crude breaching charge."])
 _B5_C1_{"Engineer and Bomber try to breach the truck&#39;s door with their makeshift explosive."}
 _B5_C1P_["The lock assembly shatters, and the container door bursts open with a clang."]
 _B6_(["Engineer and Bomber board the truck and bust open the lead shielded cesium stores."])
 _B6_1_(["The cesium canisters are placed into holdalls, with Bomber taking two."])
 _B6_2_(["As the crew prepares to leave, Lookout notices a SWAT team approaching."])
 _B6_3_(["The armed guards spill out and take up offensive positions, further threatening the crew."])
 _B6_4_(["Sniper takes aim as the others flee toward the fabrication plant."])
 _B6_5_(["Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 are hit with a flash grenade, blinding them temporarily."])
 _B6_C1_{"Under heavy fire, Lookout distracts the SWAT to give Sniper an opening."}
 _B6_C1F_["Lookout makes a run for it, but Sniper fails to get off a clean shot."]
 _B6_C2_{"Risking life and limb, Lookout goads the SWAT team by running out into the open."}
 _B6_C2P_["Distracted by Lookout&#39;s display, two SWAT agents are put down by Sniper."]
 _B6_7_(["Threat averted, the crew reconvenes at the fabrication plant, ready to make their exit."])
 _B7_1_(["More SWAT sharpshooters move in, disabling the getaway cars with precision shots to the tires."])
 _B7_2_(["Unable to hold off the attackers, the team takes refuge inside the fabrication plant."])
 _B7_3_(["Engineer and Bomber rush to the basement while the others take up defensive positions."])
 _B7_C1_{"The crew uses tear gas and suppressing fire to allow their teammates to escape."}
 _B7_C1P_["A vicious firefight sees the attackers delayed from entering the plant."]
 _B7_5_(["The weight of numbers sees the whole crew cut down but their sacrifice is not in vain."])
 _B7_6_(["Downstairs, Engineer and Bomber reach the access hatch for the intake pipe."])
 _B7_7_(["Engineer opens the hatch and Bomber climbs down with his duffel bag."])
 _B7_8_(["As the SWAT team stream in, Engineer is forced to leave the second bag behind."])
 _B7S_(["A valuable haul of radioactive material is secured, the team having paid a steep price in blood."])
 _A1_C1P_["The guards are no match for the marksmanship of Muscle #1 and Muscle #2."]
 _A4_C2F_["Sniper&#39;s continued failures allow the guards to press forward."]
 _A4_C3_{"Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 emerge from their positions to engage the guards directly."}
 _A4_C3P_["The duo&#39;s aggressive tactics force the guards to retreat into a nearby warehouse."]
 _A5_C1P_["The shaped charge blows the rear lock seam and the door shears off."]
 _A6_(["Engineer and Bomber leap into the truck and locate the lead-shielded cesium cases."])
 _A6_1_(["Each cesium canister is packed into its own duffel bag, with Bomber taking two."])
 _A6_2_(["As the crew emerges with the nuclear waste, Lookout spots trouble on the way."])
 _A6_3_(["Protected by a ballistic shield, the SWAT team takes up an offensive position."])
 _A6_C1_{"Sniper and Lookout try to fend off the SWAT team as the others flee."}
 _A6_C1P_["The armed officers are pinned by gunfire as the crew races inside the fabrication plant."]
 _A7_(["Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 lay down covering fire, allowing the sniper team to follow."])
 _A7_1_(["The crew sprints for cover as the security forces pepper them with gunfire."])
 _A7_1_Cont_(["They take up position behind their vehicles, ready to enact their escape plan."])
 _A7_C1_{"Muscle #2 deploys tear gas against the attackers while Muscle #1 opens fire."}
 _A7_C1P_["The tear gas forces the SWAT team to back off, allowing Muscle #1 to down two of them."]
 _A8_(["Seizing the chance, Engineer and Bomber bolt into the fabrication plant."])
 _A8_1_(["The others pile into the vehicles and escape before more cops arrive."])
 _A8_2_(["The authorities swarm the plant, concerned only about recovering the radioactive material."])
 _A8_2_Cont_(["In the fabrication plant basement, Engineer and Bomber reach the water intake pipe."])
 _A8_3_(["After loading the cesium, the team board the SDV and start the engine."])
 _A8S_(["The team escapes with three cesium canisters, having deceived the authorities with an elaborate getaway."])
 _A3_C1F_["The tunnel bomb fails to explode, with the remote detonator incorrectly calibrated."]
 _A3_C2_{"As the truck reverses, Sniper tries to buy Bomber some time by shooting out a tire."}
 _A3_C2P_["The truck&#39;s retreat is slowed, giving Bomber time to recalibrate and blow the road."]
 _A4_C1P_["Several guards are downed as the rest flee for cover in a nearby building."]
 _A7_C1F_["The SWAT team stops to pull on their masks, but Muscle #1 fails to take advantage."]
 _A7_2_(["The crew finds itself trapped by gunfire, unable to move without being shot."])
 _A7_3_(["Time running out, Bomber gets ready to run on Muscle #1&#39;s mark."])
 _A7_C2_{"Bomber makes a break for it with the cesium as the others open fire."}
 _A7_C2P_["Bomber bolts into the building, gunshots ringing out behind him."]
 _A8_4_(["Engineer runs out just as a flashbang is deployed and drops her duffel bag."])
 _A8_5_(["One cesium canister short, Engineer and Bomber dash downstairs with remaining bag."])
 _A8_6_(["The armed guards show up to reinforce the SWAT team, and the crew makes a break for it."])
 _A8_7_(["Tracking the cesium, the authorities ignore the diversion and follow the others into the plant."])
 _A8_7_Cont_(["Engineer and Bomber reach the intake pipe and untether the SDV."])
 _A8_8_(["The cesium is loaded and they board the submersible in double-quick time."])
 _A8S2_(["An almost perfect execution sees the team make off with two canisters of cesium."])
 _A1_C2F_["Sniper misses the mark and Muscle #2 is forced to retreat."]
 _A1_C3_{"Muscle #1 runs out firing wildly to give Muscle #2 another chance to stop the door."}
 _A1_C3P_["Muscle #1 keeps Muscle #2 covered as she reaches the door just in time."]
 _A1_5_(["Muscle #2 blows the guard away and halts the door&#39;s closing sequence."])
 _A2_C1F_["The container swings out too early, spooking the driver and causing him to slow."]
 _A2_4_(["Engineer retracts the container to make it look like an innocent mistake."])
 _A2_C2_{"Sniper prepares to fire a warning shot to force the driver to move."}
 _A2_C2F_["One of the escort team spots Sniper&#39;s sniper glint and orders the convoy to reverse."]
 _A2_5_(["Bomber blows the road to try and stop their retreat, but it&#39;s too late."])
 _A2F_(["The convoy escapes the crew&#39;s trap, their carefully orchestrated plan now in tatters."])
 _A6_C1F_["The armed officers pepper Sniper&#39;s position, forcing him to take cover."]
 _A6_C2_{"Realizing their teammates are in danger, Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 join the fray."}
 _A6_C2P_["Attacked from two directions, two members of the SWAT team are downed."]
 _B7_(["The whole crew rushes to the fabrication plant, ready to make their exit."])
 _B7_C1F_["Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 are gunned down as attackers flood the facility."]
 _B7_C2_{"With the SWAT agents closing in, Sniper and Lookout open fire."}
 _B7_C2F_["Totally surrounded, Sniper and Lookout are disarmed with shots to the upper body."]
 _B7_4_(["The SWAT team catch Engineer and Bomber in the basement before they can escape."])
 _B7_4_Cont_(["In the firefight, a stray bullet strikes one of the cesium canisters, causing it to split."])
 _B7F_(["Engineer and Bomber collapse in a cloud of failure and radioactive waste."])
 _A2_C2P_["Startled by gunfire, the lead driver hits the gas and tries to lead them away."]
 _A3_(["Engineer swings the container into position and drops it to block the convoy."])
 _A3_C2F_["Sniper fails to halt the truck, and the driver reverses it clear of the danger zone."]
 _A3_1_(["Two armed guards surprise the crew from behind the shipping container and open fire."])
 _A3F_(["Sniper and Lookout are shot as the others escape in a hijacked vehicle."])
 _B6_C1P_["Lookout&#39;s bravery sees Sniper gain the upper hand over the SWAT team."]
 _A5_C2P_["Weakened by the initial blast, the door finally gives way with a hard clang."]
 _A6_C2F_["Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 are hit with flash grenades, temporarily blinding them both."]
 _A1_C3F_["Muscle #2 is cut down as the heavy goods door slams shut."]
 _A1_6_(["Muscle #1 tries to reach him but is blindsided by a shot from another guard."])
 _A1F_(["Under heavy fire, the rest of the crew bolts, leaving their teammates to face the consequences."])
 _A4_C3F_["The guards nail Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 in quick succession."]
 _A4_2_(["One guard takes out Sniper before he can find cover."])
 _A4F_(["Outmanned and outgunned, the rest of the team scatters, the mission a total failure."])
 _A7_C2F_["Bomber is downed with a shot to the leg, and a holdall is dropped."]
 _A7_C3_{"Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 reload, hoping to do a better job covering Engineer."}
